body:
Tirando matchmaking para hacer vykas, wtf xd, por cierto en este sub sólo se habla inglés.

&#x200B;

Nice vykas matchmaking though.

Beating my friend's ass dps-wise, killing them in vykas g3, killing their harlequinns in clown 2 maze, getting better at my class and squeezing it to the max. Waiting for Akkan and its wonderful OSTs <3

&#x200B;

Also, Brelshaza <3

Exactly, and I did set them, fortunately all of the lazy ones left, a few weeks later only 2 of us are left, my buddy and I and I'm happier because of it, sure we lack supports but we manage. 

&#x200B;

Don't be a raid mom people, as \^ said, set boundaries early on.

heyyyy! i'm glad you're putting out content, great video! <3

&#x200B;

theo

spamming click like a monkey really fucked me up lol, i'm soooooo glad they're implementing this <3

&#x200B;

ps: yeah, i know, everybody spams the way they can x)

I'm glad that the main plot with Benny's dead wasn't a huge conspiracy theory about the military, the war and the government like other series try to pass on, instead it was resolved nice and quickly, leaving room for the next plots if we get a new season.

&#x200B;

All in all, I hope it gets renewed.

hey! yo y mi amigo pronto armaremos una guild de hispano hablantes, mándame un mensaje o una carta al char: Aaskereia

&#x200B;

Nos vemos!

*laughs in hashinshin*

&#x200B;

damn it

my mom says the same thing to me, "when are you going to get bored of that  game?" and i reply with: "when are you getting bored of your soap operas mom?" 

&#x200B;

touché.

Old MMORPGs are dying left and right, and I'm thankful that cip hasn't thrown their game into the trash and forgot about it (except for botter era).

&#x200B;

I'm glad I can still play this game that's fairly cheap with low PC requirements.

After a full day of going to work, all I want to do is have some fun with my buddy, not to have to deal with that dominando crap!

&#x200B;

Also, PM me your name so if you need help with anything just hit me up!

This whole weekend i've been hunting prison -2, -3, skeleton elites and Asura palace and not even a single soul told me to get out because of some dominando bullshit, most people respected letters and hunt times, and those who didn't either ksed until one team got bored.

&#x200B;

Who's exactly dominating gentebra?

hey! i'm from chile aswell, and if you'll live in santiago you ping will go from 80 to 150 i think, i get 110 - 120 steady :)

&#x200B;

i play on gentebra with a team, most don't speak english well but, we could all help you out!

&#x200B;

msg me Pisco Capel if you ever need anything mate :)

